---
import '../styles/garden.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="冯黄煜的个人主页，记录日常思考与学习轨迹。"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#8b73ac"/><link rel="icon" href="/avatar.jpg"/><title>冯黄煜 · 思考与学习</title><script is:inline>try{document.documentElement.dataset.theme=localStorage.getItem('garden-theme')||'light'}catch{}</script></head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">跳到内容</a>
<header class="nav"><a class="brand" href="#/" aria-label="冯黄煜首页"><span class="brand-icon">✿</span>冯黄煜</a><nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#/" data-nav="home">首页</a><a href="#/records" data-nav="records">思考与记录</a><a href="#/progress" data-nav="progress">学习轨迹</a></nav><div class="nav-tools"><button class="icon-btn" id="theme" aria-label="切换深浅色">☾</button><button class="primary compact" data-action="new">＋ 写一篇</button></div></header>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><h1>你好，我是冯黄煜。</h1><p>这里记录我的日常思考与学习轨迹。</p></div><img class="hero-art" src="/background.jpg" alt="两位卡通伙伴一起走过溪流的插画" fetchpriority="high"/></section>
<div class="shell"><aside class="sidebar"><section class="profile panel"><img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="我的小猪头像" class="avatar"/><h2>冯黄煜</h2><p>思考、学习、实践。</p><div class="profile-stats" id="profile-stats"></div><button class="primary wide" data-action="new">＋ 写下新的思考</button></section><section class="panel topic-panel"><h3><span class="accent-dot"></span>主题</h3><div id="topics"></div></section><section class="panel profile-links"><a href="https://github.com/redyellowgreenred" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a><a href="/previous-site/">论文与项目</a><button class="text-btn" id="export">导出记录</button></section></aside>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div id="notice" role="status"></div><div id="app"><div class="panel loading">正在打开你的学习花园…</div></div></main></div>
<dialog id="editor" aria-labelledby="editor-title"><form id="note-form"><div class="dialog-head"><div><h2 id="editor-title">写一篇记录</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-btn" data-action="close" aria-label="关闭编辑">×</button></div><input type="hidden" name="id"/><div class="form-grid"><label class="full">标题<input name="title" placeholder="今天在思考什么？" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>日期<input name="date" type="date" required/></label><label>主题<input name="topic" placeholder="例如：前端开发" maxlength="40" required list="topic-list"/><datalist id="topic-list"></datalist></label><label>内容类型<select name="kind"><option value="thought">日常思考</option><option value="learning">学习记录</option></select></label><label class="learning-field">投入时间（分钟）<input name="minutes" type="number" min="0" max="1440" value="30" required/></label><label class="learning-field">掌握阶段<select name="stage"><option value="understand">初步了解</option><option value="practice">正在练习</option><option value="apply">能够独立应用</option></select></label><label class="full">正文<textarea name="notes" rows="6" placeholder="记下概念、过程、例子，以及还没弄明白的问题。" maxlength="30000" required></textarea></label><label class="full">思考与收获<textarea name="gains" rows="3" placeholder="现在的我，比学习前多理解了什么？做成了什么？" maxlength="10000" required></textarea></label></div><div class="resource-heading"><h3>相关资料</h3><button class="text-btn" type="button" id="add-resource">＋ 添加资料</button></div><div id="resource-fields"></div><p class="form-error" id="form-error" role="alert"></p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary" type="button" data-action="close">取消</button><button class="primary" id="save" type="submit">准备提交到 GitHub</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="delete-dialog" aria-labelledby="delete-title"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="delete-title">删除这条记录？</h2></div><p>将在 GitHub 打开删除页面，提交后生效。</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary" id="cancel-delete">保留记录</button><button class="danger" id="confirm-delete">确认删除</button></div></dialog>
<dialog id="publish-dialog" aria-labelledby="publish-title"><div class="dialog-head"><div><p class="muted">草稿已保存在当前浏览器</p><h2 id="publish-title">还差一次 GitHub 提交</h2></div><button class="icon-btn" id="close-publish" aria-label="关闭发布提示">×</button></div><p id="publish-help" class="muted"></p><div class="publish-actions"><button class="secondary" id="copy-record">复制记录内容</button><button class="secondary" id="download-record">下载记录文件</button><a class="primary" id="github-submit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">去 GitHub 提交</a></div><p class="muted">在 GitHub 点击「Commit changes」后，网站会自动更新。只有仓库所有者可以提交。更新完成后刷新本站即可看到记录。</p></dialog>
<div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<script>import '../scripts/app.js';</script>
</body></html>
